{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3cff7844a2e31ad016acb1b606aea07bc7f81d0b3da66c091cb216eab0d115b1","ja":"ファンのみんなに囲まれて","zh":"被粉丝们包围着","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1258bce37fcccab874d672cc7ece2597b256b44dc13d804db9924cebed9f00bd","ja":"「ロングラン公演、お疲れさまでした～～～！」\nパチパチパチパチ……！","zh":"“长期公演，大家辛苦了～～～！”\n啪啪啪啪啪……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"69b335b50ace9c95962415104cabe83d6134501828762bead5154d84305deb64","ja":"わあ、お花とケーキだ！\nこれ、わたしたちに！？","zh":"哇，是花和蛋糕！\n这些，是给我们的吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cb2dca27b5f7f0a66526dd48f974854c850043d8f37656596f12f22e7fe8e760","ja":"「はい！　実は今回の収録、音楽番組じゃなくて……\nロングラン公演完走のお祝い番組だったんです！」","zh":"“是的！其实这次的录制并不是音乐节目……\n而是庆祝长期巡回演出圆满收官的特别节目！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c4ac9dd9f4fd186a6de65cb5f73207f3f8268eb2ce64743527e927e565f650dc","ja":"ええっ！？\n二段構えのドッキリだったの！？","zh":"诶！？\n居然是双重整蛊吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"91ca1c35d2e6a2b6cb13e4e735992b7a41ff1e40a3061bb27745e67ed6a5bd37","ja":"はっ！　では、公演を見てくれた方々が\n共演者だったのも、偶然ではなかったんですね！","zh":"啊！也就是说，来看演出的那些人\n其实是共演者，这也不是巧合对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e2df3a6eb59db08cd4bb264dc419a244eb1b70be369e10f3ab8658c592e827dc","ja":"「はい、私達もぜひ、お祝いにかけつけたくて♪」\n「ロングラン公演、すごく楽しませてもらいました！」","zh":"「是的，我们也一定要赶来祝贺♪」\n「长线公演让我们看得很开心！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"53d7a5e82dbbd5f9ace9c0e3ff7f57cdf0c32eba4f826681b9c5f68cd4777405","ja":"ふおぉぉぉ～！\nありがとうございますぅ～～～！","zh":"哇哦哦哦～！\n太感谢您了～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9f024c055cb18e21cc3410d011e515f697b62669da6df89762363b5809746981","ja":"「さらに！　このホテルに入った瞬間から、\nみなさんの姿を生配信でお届けしています！」","zh":"“不仅如此！从进入这家酒店的瞬间起，\n各位的身影就已经在全程直播了！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c83f9023eb1d5a65c4e7fbc082ef7d20d29bf4726fcf5c303b1f59e5aba178dd","ja":"わぁ～……！　視聴者さんからのコメント、\nリアルタイムでいただけてるんですね！","zh":"哇～……！观众发来的评论，\n能实时收到呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ef35e0ed2a497faa3b90aadf2414dff0efda272680112ed202b6f72412abfe56","ja":"お祝いの言葉がたくさん……ありがとうございますっ！\nはぁ～、すっごく嬉しいです♪","zh":"收到了好多祝福的话语……非常感谢！\n呼～，真的太高兴了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"22ea8a80af7447be9deb0264f06b95ed7f60fa8a485d80fd20d8d6d4bde33c02","ja":"「おっと、これで終わりではありませんよ！\nファンのみなさんが、ライブを待ち望んでいます！」","zh":"“哎呀，这可还没结束哦！\n粉丝们还在热切期盼着演唱会呢！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"9c7512670c73c22eb4cf88f2e87824392c1de5732224a7063bdbc1608ad2b989","ja":"ふふ！\nありがとう、全力でいかせてもらうわね♪","zh":"呵呵！\n谢谢，我会全力以赴的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c4b237f106b9dc12ae3cbc8a58681c3c2b4f0fbe438ef33669d42dceb7305b92","ja":"うん！　あっ、あっちの部屋に、\nステージがあるよ！","zh":"嗯！啊，那边的房间里，\n有个舞台哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"c356c24ff193141543fb26eb2c9ad494b246b0b6d8a3c51b213b1a110f4dd9a1","ja":"じゃあ今からみなさんへ、\nありがとうの気持ちをたくさん届けます。だから……。","zh":"那么现在，我就要把满满的感谢之情\n传达给大家。所以……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1555.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"b59aed044aeffdd59b8479c107c0c24d799b78964e482eadf6061dd76178860a","ja":"受け取ってくださいっ！","zh":"请收下！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
